# The Living Planet Database (LPI) data cannot be redistributed under the
# LPI Data Use Policy, so the whole data/ folder (raw CSV plus any cleaned or
# intermediate files we create) is kept out of version control.
# See README.md for how to download the dataset.
data/

# External (USFWS) data and source reports are also kept out of version
# control. The reports are public domain, but DOI asks that its documents be
# linked to rather than re-hosted; see README.md for the report links.
data_external/

# Course requirements checklist (working notes, not part of the repository)
TIER_REQUIREMENTS.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/
